title Compact Context Safely - Target Overview
participant "Execution Host" as Host
participant "Managed Session" as Session
participant "Compaction policy" as Policy
participant Model
database "Append-only history" as History
Host -> Session : Continue execution with captured model window [P]
Session -> Policy : Evaluate input and context; prepare safe cut
Policy --> Session : Window and recovery policy
break No safe compactable window
  Session --> Host : Continue or fail under the existing execution policy
end
Session -> Model : Summarize prepared context
Model --> Session : Summary or failure
alt Valid summary with useful reduction
  Session -> History : Append summary and retained boundary\nplus discarded identity when recovering
  History --> Session : Committed compaction
  Session -> Session : Install new context
  opt Failed overflow call is eligible for its first recovery
    Session -> Model : Retry original model call once
    Model --> Session : Final Assistant outcome
  end
else Invalid, failed or cancelled summary
  Session -> Session : Keep previous context
end
Session --> Host : Execution outcome
note over Session,Policy
  No safe window: do not start compaction.
  Successful answers are never replayed.
  [P] = Pending implementation increment.
end note
