participant "Model service" as Models
database "Session history" as Store
participant "Execution Host" as Host
Caller -> Admission : Submit the next message to an idle Session
Admission -> Directory : Read published bindings and default
Directory --> Admission : Latest validated runtime metadata
Admission -> Models : Resolve current model or allowed default
Models --> Admission : Callable model or unavailable
break No callable model
  Admission --> Caller : Reject before accepting user.message
end
opt Model reconciliation changes configuration
  Admission -> Store : Commit model and required thinking changes
  Store --> Admission : Authoritative configuration events
  Admission --> Caller : Configuration events before message receipt
end
Admission -> Store : Accept user.message and mark running
Admission -> Host : Start with reconciled immutable snapshot
